IfcOpenShell
  Not vendored. Installed from PyPI at run time by tools/replay.sh and by the
  CI gate, and executed as a separate process. IfcOpenShell is LGPL-3.0; it is
  never linked into anything in this repository.

ifc-lite-core (IFClite)
  Not vendored. Fetched from crates.io at build time at the exact pinned
  version 7.1.1, compiled into the witnesses/ifc-lite binary only, and
  executed as a separate process. Upstream is LTplus-AG/ifc-lite;
  ifc-lite-core is MPL-2.0. witnesses/ifc-lite is deliberately its own Cargo
  workspace root and is not built by anything else here, so MPL-2.0 code is
  never linked into an Apache-2.0 artifact. MPL-2.0 is a file-level copyleft:
  no file of ifc-lite-core is modified by this repository, and no source of
  it is redistributed here. Its full license text is at
  https://github.com/LTplus-AG/ifc-lite and in the crate itself.

